[resource]
script = ExtResource("4_ueux4")
username = "pinchofsalt"
rating = 4.5
review_content = "Oh, Tippy, you are just DARLING!

Ever since my parents fired my last au pair, I've been forced to drag myself into these wretched streets whenever I want a sweet treat. All the other cafes around here are just absolute pigsties, filled to the brim with loudmouthed bums and smarmy baristas. Thanks to these machines, I've been able to cast my fears of some unwashed boor getting in the way of my matcha to the wayside! 

...Until today, at least. This afternoon, I ordered the same thing that I always do, and they made the most dreadful mistake— OAT milk in my drink, instead of ALMOND! As far as they know, I could be deathly allergic to oats! Could you imagine, dear reader? Why, as far as you know, I could just be on my deathbed as I write this! 

Well, the sweaty man behind the machines offered to remake it for free, and although daddy has always advised against handouts, I am a kind enough person that I gracefully obliged. It was even better than usual— I suppose there's some good in keeping help around…"
customer_sprite_data_options = Array[ExtResource("1_eb0n5")]([ExtResource("2_xlh8h")])
